wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chelvin\" title=\"Chelvin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Chelvin.png/25px-Portrait_Chelvin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Chelvin.png/38px-Portrait_Chelvin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Chelvin.png/50px-Portrait_Chelvin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Harper Chelvin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Chelvin.png/25px-Portrait_Chelvin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Portrait_Chelvin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chelvin\" title=\"Chelvin\">Harper Chelvin</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Danthelon%27s_Dancing_Axe\" title=\"Danthelon's Dancing Axe\">Danthelon's Dancing Axe</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>You won't have to wear those <a href=\"/wiki/Harper\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Harper\">Harper</a> smiles much longer - Orin has given the order.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Kill the crone. But not before you tell her how her little soldiers died.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Preserve some hair or sinew if you can. The Chosen would like to string a harp of her own.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202023\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2366/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32123/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8333/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 939469/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion